@startuml
state Created
state Ready
state BusyDownstreamFlow
state BusyOperation
state BusyLoadport

[*] --> Created
Created --> Ready: InitializeChainedActorCmd(MaterialFlowChainHandlers)
Ready --> BusyDownstreamFlow: PushDownstreamCmd(Part)
BusyDownstreamFlow --> Ready: MaterialflowResult(OK)
BusyDownstreamFlow --> BlockedDownstream: MaterialFlowResult() [downstream actor indicates blocked]
Ready --> BusyOperation: StartOperationCmd()
BusyOperation --> Ready: CycleTime elapsed
BlockedDownstream --> BusyLoadport: UnloadCmd
BusyLoadport --> Ready: done

@enduml